WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:05.320
Ever wondered about the mysterious secret
desires of SCP-261, the Pan-Dimensional Vending

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.320
Machine?

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.750
Researchers took a photo of it sitting alone
in its hallway, and the result was a photo

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:16.020
of the hallway full of yen coins, to a depth
of approximately 160 cm; the upper portion

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.910
of SCP-261 is visible emerging from the pile
of coins.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:22.519
Turns out it’s just greedy, I guess…

